  ],
  "solution": "def flatten_list(lists: list[list[int]]) -> list[int]:\n    flat = []\n    for l in lists:\n        flat.extend(l)\n    return sorted(flat)\n",
  "explanation": "Flattens sublists and orders entries in O(N log N) time."
